/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/app/DoctrineMigrations/sql/mtb_card_detail_1.sql:57345:','Most such relics remain clasped shut for fear of what ominous truths might be carved into the diptych inside.','(１),(Ｔ),あなたの手札から、共通の色１色を持つカードを２枚公開する：カードを１枚引く。','{1}, {Tap}, Reveal two cards from your hand that share a color: Draw a card.','','','254',0,false,0,'2018-07-26 01:42:19+09','2025-07-31 21:44:47+09'),
